aph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"整体遍历：9 个格子中每种元素恰好出现 3 次"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三、解题步骤"}]},{"type":"textDiagram","attrs":{"language":"mermaid"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"flowchart TD\n    A[元素相似且重复出现] --> B[统计每行/每列元素种类]\n    B --> C{每行/列种类一致?}\n    C -->|是| D[找出问号处缺少的元素]\n    C -->|否| E[尝试整体遍历]\n    D --> F[组合缺失元素]\n    E --> G[统计每种元素总出现次数]\n    F --> H[选对应选项]\n    G --> H"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"四、真题精讲"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【例题】九宫格每行都包含正方形、圆形、三角形，以及横线、竖线、斜线。第三行前两个图已出现正方形和圆形，缺少三角形，同时缺少横线和斜线。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每行元素种类一致 → 遍历"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"第三行缺少：三角形 + 横线 + 斜线「/」"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"选由这三种元素组合而成的选项"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"五、易错点"}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#fef2f2","borderColor":"#ef4444","icon":"⚠️"},"content":[{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"遍历和运算的区别：遍历是「每种都出现一次」，运算是「图形之间做加减」"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"优先横着看，再竖着看"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"遍历可以和位置规律复合出现"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#eff6ff","borderColor":"#3b82f6","icon":"📊"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷题建议：","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"遍历在图形推理中占比约 3%，属于低频考点，但一旦出现很容易拿分。核心就是「缺啥补啥」四个字。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '图形推理样式类-遍历的核心考点：整体遍历、行列遍历、缺啥补啥。', category_node.id, CAST('["图形推理", "样式规律", "遍历", "缺啥补啥"]' AS jsonb), FA